# ─── engagement data — NEVER publish ────────────────────────────────────────
# targets/ holds live scope, VPS IPs, researcher handles, and TEST CREDENTIALS
# (accounts.md). Only the empty skeleton and the registry pointer are shareable.
targets/*
!targets/_template/
!targets/TARGETS.example.md
# generated view of a brain — regenerate it, never track it

# ─── knowledge/ — LOCAL BUILD-TIME INPUT ───────────────────────────────────
# Users put reports, research, notes and experiments here to re-evaluate a named skill/playbook.
# Source material and its evaluation manifest stay local; only guides and optional helpers ship.
knowledge/*
!knowledge/README.md
!knowledge/reports/
knowledge/reports/*
!knowledge/reports/README.md
# Optional knowledge helpers ship. Source-specific credentials come through config.py or env.
!knowledge/tools/
!knowledge/tools/*
# MINED.tsv describes YOUR knowledge and evaluation decisions.
knowledge/MINED.tsv

# ─── secrets & machine config ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# config.json holds API keys, the VPS address and your researcher handle.
# config.example.json is the committed template — keep them in sync when adding a field.
config.json

# ─── local machine / tool scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.playwright-mcp/
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tmp

# local maintainer pre-push audit wrapper; public CI runs its checks directly
tools/doctor.py
.notify-spool.jsonl
lessons.md
